          "type": "phase",
          "settings": {
            "day_range": "Day 60 – 75",
            "title": "Longevity",
            "text": "<p>This is not the end. It's the baseline. Skin that functions as designed, maintaining from a structurally different starting point. The goal of regenerative science: a result that holds.</p>"
          }
